  <p>
    When you use Online Services to reach an account or run transactions, Employee Benefits Corporation
    may require multi-factor authentication. That may include providing at least one telephone number
    that can receive a verification code by SMS/text, voice call, or email. Carrier message and data
    rates may apply under your mobile plan.
  </p>

  <h3>Online Security</h3>
  <p>
    You agree to choose a password that is not easy for others to guess and to keep it confidential.
    Take reasonable steps to stop unauthorized password use. Employee Benefits Corporation is not liable
    for unauthorized access or transactions that occur before it is notified of the problem.
  </p>

  <h3>Alerts Service</h3>
  <p>
