    <li>Upload files that violate intellectual property or privacy rights without authority.</li>
    <li>Upload malware, corrupted files, or programs that harm another system.</li>
    <li>Advertise or solicit sales unless the specific Communication Service allows it.</li>
    <li>Download content you know (or should know) cannot lawfully be distributed that way.</li>
    <li>Remove or falsify authorship, legal notices, or source labels on uploaded material.</li>
    <li>Block others from using Communication Services.</li>
    <li>Break applicable codes of conduct, guidelines, laws, or regulations.</li>
    <li>Harvest contact data about others without consent.</li>
